{
  "about": "Footage per shot (ids from src/cut.ts). Files live in public/footage/<shot>/. 'files': one MP4/WebM clip (at least as long as the shot), or PNG/JPG stills shown in turn. 'sequence': a numbered PNG sequence ('pattern' with %0Nd, 'count', 'start', 'fps'). 'aspect': footage width/height. 'keyframes': at = 0..1 of the shot; focus = rect in footage coordinates (0..1) the zoom centres on; scale = zoom at that point. A shot with no files and no sequence fails the render.",
